Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You all move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.61,0:01:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's a poor Jueless to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you throw your monsters in\Ndefense mode, I'll fossilize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you throw them in\Nattack, I'll destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. I'm trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.61,0:01:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless maybe this combo works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play the Dark\NMagician in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.15,0:01:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also protect him\Nwith the magical hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Pegasus can't tell which hat\NYugi's hidden his Dark Magician in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the Magician is safe from\NPegasus's toon monster attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,With your feeble attempt\Nto hide your Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you're hoping to stall until you can\Nfind a way to overcome my toon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't work. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not capable of\Nconcealing your secrets from
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,me and those silly magic\Nhats won't help you hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is probe your feeble\Nmind to learn which hat hides your mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten the\Npower of my millennium eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well surrender now and save
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself the embarrassment\Nof a crushing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do if Pegasus reads my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If he learns where the magician is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way I can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come on, stay with it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Pegasus has magic, but so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic of your Millennium\NPuzzle. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have my own kind of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic that merges me with the\Nspirit of the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit, listen to me. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel Pegasus trying to claw\Nhis way into our minds again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.31,0:03:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa told me that if\NI wanted to defeat Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have to harness the power\Nof my Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that he meant I should\Nmerge with you as we usually do,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and that together we would be triumphant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I think I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa said to trust in the\Npower of my Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but he never said anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm to have any chance\Nof beating Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have to banish you\Nfrom the corridors of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, if we don't work together,\Nwe won't stand a chance. Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we keep playing\Nlike we have, we'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing because\NPegasus can read our mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're working so close together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's the wrong strategy for us\Nto be using in this particular game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep dueling with\Nour spirits merged,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' mind-reading powers will beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we lose, everyone loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have another idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it had better be a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Many lives depend on us. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think it will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it will allow us to stop\NPegasus from reading our thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me quickly, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel Pegasus pushing at our mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to probe our thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Each time we play a card,\NPegasus reads our mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if we keep our minds separate\Nand then switch our minds back and forth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, switch minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying we won't merge\Nour spirits as we usually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, we keep our thoughts\Nseparate, secret, even from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A dangerous move, but it\Njust might work. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.53,0:04:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon Summon Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Emerge from the safety of Toon World and\Nattack the magical hat on the far left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician has\Nperformed his last trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're losing your touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Boy's life points are unaffected?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Dark Magician card\Nis still on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I just read his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,His magician had to be\Nhidden under that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt him resisting my probe, but\Nthere's no way he could have deceived me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you probed the wrong mind, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,One that doesn't know where\Nthe Dark Magician hides.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe your mind-probing powers\Naren't as all-seeing as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare mock the awesome\Npowers of my Millennium Eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You go too far, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya, do you have\Nany idea what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it has to do\Nwith Yugi's other spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's somehow using the\Nspirit from his Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzle to confuse Pegasus and\Nblock him from reading minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You gained nothing from\Nyour attack, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with your magic,\Nyou won't be able to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're not the only\Nduelist with a Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see how well your Millennium\NEye measures up to my Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope he knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how much do any of us really\Nknow about his Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Puzzle, Millennium Schmuzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish I could help him somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But no, all I can do is\Ncheer from the sidelines,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,while my best buddy duels his\Ntoughest duel all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I lay this card face down on\Nthe field and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, do you know what the card is\Nthat I just pulled and laid on the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just use your Millennium\NEye to read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if you think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can hide nothing from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what that hidden\Ncard is that you just played.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Pegasus, but I don't know\Nwhat this face-down card is either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading my mind will tell\Nyou absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Pegasus, I don't know what that\Ncard is because I am no longer Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but someone else altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the magic of the Millennium\NPuzzle, two minds inhabit this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now each time you try to read one of\Nour minds, we'll use the Mind Shuffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind Shuffle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Told ya, Yugi's battling Pegasus\Nwith not one, but two minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Pegasus tries to\Nread one of his minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi can switch back to the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Two minds are better than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:08:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back our prisoner now and we\Nmight still let you leave in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, you've got nowhere else to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, punk, what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You ignorant mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far from all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We have barely even begun to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll show you the\Ncards fate has dealt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with Bakura all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I remember him\Nacting like this once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was when the evil spirit from Bakura's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Ring dragged us\Nall to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was just a bad dream,\Nbut it looks like it really did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like that\Nevil Bakura is back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll teach you the true meaning\Nof fear as I summon the man-eater bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of my Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's brought the monster\Non the car to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's going to sick it on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you mortal fools,\Nprepare to meet your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Present-day humans are so fun\Nto terrorize, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, I am a present-day human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, someone with great\Npower, soon to be greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't spend the day having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll summon the\Nmorphing jar to this plane
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and put an end to their pathetic whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The jar's magic will send these\Nridiculous thugs to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the heck is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, still trying to read my mind, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind-scanning abilities\Nare only one of many
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,skills that I possess and\Nthat you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten\Nwho invented this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can sense that\Nyou're prepared to switch minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're ready to switch again the\Nmoment I begin to probe your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So rather than waste both our\Ntime, let's move on, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've still no defense\Nagainst my Toon monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's only a matter of time till I\Nfind which hat hides your dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then pick a hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll see just how impressive your\Nmastery of duel monsters really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but i suspect that you've relied on\Nthe magic of your millennium eye for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so long your dueling skills have\Ndiminished even if your little theory
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,was true i'm still far and away a\Nsuperior duelist to you we shall see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,pegasus make your next move toon\Nsummon skull attack the middle hand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have gotten him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.19,0:11:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've missed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Another turn wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And for my next turn, a\Nquick change is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've switched again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And our mind shuffle strategy\Nis working perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:11:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Living Arrow card could\Nreally turn this match around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll just play this card face\Ndown and I'll see you later, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's played another card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no point in\Ntrying to read this Yugi's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,mind because he has no idea\Nwhat card it is either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yugi's played another card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though I don't know what\Nthat card is, I have faith in Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And faith in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm becoming annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eureka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The card that will devastate\Nyour dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical Neutralizing Force, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This special card acts to\Neliminate any and all magic effects
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,currently active on the\Nopponent's field which means the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,concealing effect of your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical hats now disappear. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the magic hats are evaporating\Nthe dark magician is revealed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all over for him and your life points
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you can only watch as i\Nsavor my final victory
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,does your heart grow cold knowing\Nthat your demise is only moments away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Toon Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them the face of victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,His Toon monsters are\Nvirtually unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and my Dark Magician\Nis totally unprotected!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do, unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Strike Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Devastate his dark magician
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a move, but Yugi might
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus. No, they've switched\Nagain. I defend my magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,With the card I played face down\NThe magic card, living arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hidden card is the living arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my secret card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you're the\Ncreator of Duel Monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you must know all about\Nthe Living Arrow card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And how it can fuse with any card\Nan opponent might put into play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't matter whether that\Ncard is a monster card or a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've thwarted your mind-reading magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and now we're going to use your\Nvery own magic card against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the Living Arrow card\Nto fuse with your Magical
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.57,0:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutralizing card and fire\Nit right back at Toon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.39,0:15:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,cause it's already too late for\Nyou to stop my Summon Skull Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Dark Magician is vanquished!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.47,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've forgotten my other down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's one of my favorites,\NMirror Force. A trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It deflects back, summons Skull's attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and since the other card neutralized the\Nmagic that made your toons untouchable,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,your toon monsters return to their\Noriginal form and appear on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,just in time to catch the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you've\Ndestroyed all my beloved toons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare, a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't truly be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.09,0:16:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All the toons are destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it was your plan, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Score stands at Yugi 900, Pegasus 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has proven formidable indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and his Millennium item is even\Nmore intriguing than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.78,0:16:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're in the lead, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Those creepy toon monsters\Nseemed almost unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I knew Yuggie'd figure\Nout a way to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,there's not a single particle of those\Npathetic fools left in this dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no patience for\Nobstacles that get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you did that,\Nand I probably don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me who you are, what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're not really\Nour friend Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one Yugi beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He banished you to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the process he freed\NBakura from your mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but that wouldn't have happened\Nif Bakura hadn't betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided I need a new host.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't take me without\Na fight. Not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a vessel without a\Nmind or soul of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You want Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now turn him over or face\Nthe same fate as those gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you were just another boy who\Nshowed some faint dueling promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but with my gentle guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just look at you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one step away from\Nbecoming world champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been to the Shadow Realm\Nand back, and most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you've finally begun to master the\Npower of your Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And you see, Yugi, for me, that's what\Nthis whole tournament has been about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For I plan to take\Npossession of your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My puzzle? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and I will finish this\Ncontest in the Shadow Realm, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:18:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, it's winner take all.
